<title>USA: Industrial Training names Sanders chairman.</title>
<headline>Industrial Training names Sanders chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HERNDON, Va. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Training Corp said Tuesday it had named John Sanders as chairman, succeeding Bill Walton, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Walton will remain CEO, it said.</p>
<p>Sanders has been a director of the company since its founding in 1977, ITC said.</p>
